{"title": "404 与两种 400 的边界", "lines": [
  {"t": "cmd", "s": "curl -sw \"%{http_code}\" localhost/css/??style1.css,missing.css"},
  {"t": "out", "s": "404"},
  {"t": "cmd", "s": "curl -sw \"%{http_code}\" ??style1.css,style2.css,style3.css,style1.css"},
  {"t": "out", "s": "400"},
  {"t": "out", "s": "error.log: client sent too many concat filenames"},
  {"t": "cmd", "s": "curl -sw \"%{http_code}\" ...css/??style1.css,notes.txt"},
  {"t": "out", "s": "400（error.log 无新增）"},
  {"t": "note", "s": "类型不在 concat_types 静默 400；去 mime.types 全静默"},
  {"t": "note", "s": "实测：Alpine 容器自编译 nginx 1.28.0"}
]}
